  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Parcel match: city APN 728-34-030 was subdivided and isn't in county data. 728-60-041 is 18600 Corte Arcangel, which an MLS listing places in Borello Ranch Estates. One lot stands in for the 122-acre project; 114 lots are in Phases 3 and 4.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001886",
        "SRC-001885"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Toll Brothers: gated community of single- and two-story homes, 3,500 to 6,000+ sq ft, 4-5 bedrooms, 3- or 4-car garages, home sites up to 24,000+ sq ft; 7,000 sq ft recreation center; pricing from $2.89 million (Feb 2025) and about $2.9 million (Sep 2025); sales center 18251 Corte Augustin.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002525",
        "SRC-002526"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2010 report: planned as San Sebastian Homes on agricultural land near Cochrane, Half and Peet roads; average lot about 15,000 sq ft; about 16.5 acres of common open space; private streets; construction to be phased over seven to 10 years.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002524"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report lists per-lot building permits and certificates of occupancy labeled Borello Ranch in 2018 and 2021 (Corte Arcangel, Corte Paterna, Via Santa Elena, Via Orista, Via Tolentino, Corte Matheo, Corte Bautista, Via Potano), and a 2023 Phase 4 permit (BRES2023-0234) at Cochrane Rd/Peet Rd.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001135"
      ]
    }
  ],
